lized on the main thread to enable push notification","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"automation. SDK initialization must happen before the application has finished launching","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"or in your AppDelegate ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/archive.is\/nUG1k","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" implementation.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"If the application setup requires the SDK to be initialized after the application has","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"finished launching, refer to the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Braze\/documentation\/BrazeKit\/Braze\/prepareForDelayedInitialization(pushAutomation:analyticsBehavior:)","type":"reference"},{"text":" method.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside","style":"important","name":"Important"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The automation steps performed by the SDK are compatible with pre-existing push"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"notification handling integrations in your codebase. The SDK only automates the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"processing of remote notification received from Braze. Any system handler implemented"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to process your own or another third party SDK remote notifications will continue to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"work when "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"automation"},{"type":"text","text":" is enabled."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Note"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"By default, the SDK does not perform any automation steps and you are required to implement","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UIApplicationDelegate"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice",